So I need a different approach to actually redact the content. Let me think about this...

The LangWatch SDK supports `spanProcessors` option where I can pass custom OpenTelemetry span processors. I could create a custom span processor that intercepts spans before they're exported and redacts `SECRET_TOKEN` in the span attributes.

